  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Relief for Turkey &amp; Syria Earthquake</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With our Search &amp; Rescue team returning to South Africa, we continue to provide emergency medical care at our two hospitals in Syria. We are providing emergency relief items such as tents, sleeping bags, gas heaters and portable toilets, and daily meals to those affected. From our kitchen in Darkoush we serve meals as far as Northern regions of Syria, &amp; Turkey. Additionally, we&apos;ve established a compound along the Turkish border that provides shelter to more than 350 families.</narrative>
  </description>
